<title>USA: Floyd County SDFC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Floyd County SDFC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co, Inc said it won $3.465 milli on of Floyd County School District Finance Corporation, Ky., school building ref unding revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.72 percent.</p>
